msgid "Vibration correlation programs"
msgstr "振动关联程序"

msgid "The VCI program (VCI)"
msgstr "VCI 程序 (VCI)"

msgid ""
"``VCI`` calculations account for vibration correlation effects and use "
"potential energy surfaces as generated from the ``XSURF`` program and a "
"basis of ``VSCF`` modals or harmonic oscillator functions. For each "
"vibrational state an individual ``VCI`` calculation will be performed. As "
"``VCI`` calculations may require substantial computer resources, these "
"calculations can be rather expensive. Currently, two different ``VCI`` "
"programs (configuration selective and conventional) are available (see "
"below).  The details of the ``VCI`` program are described in:"
msgstr ""
"``VCI`` 计算考虑了振动关联效应，并使用由 ``XSURF`` 程序生成的势能面以及基于 ``VSCF`` "
"模态或谐振子函数的基组。对于每个振动态，将执行单独的 ``VCI`` 计算。由于 ``VCI`` "
"计算可能需要大量的计算资源，这些计算可能相当昂贵。目前，有两种不同的 ``VCI`` 程序（组态选择型和常规型）可用（见下文）。\\ ``VCI`` "
"程序的详细信息在以下文献中描述："

msgid "Options"
msgstr "选项"

msgid "The following *options* are available:"
msgstr "以下\\ *选项*\\ 可用："

msgid "Rovibrational (RVCI) calculations"
msgstr "转动振动（RVCI）计算"

msgid ""
"By default, the ``VCI`` program calculates purely vibrational states only. "
"However, the ``ROVIB`` directive allows for the calculation of rovibrational"
" transitions for molecules with Abelian point groups. This includes also the"
" IR intensities once dipole moment surfaces have been computed and Raman "
"intensities if they are available and requested in the vibrational "
"calculation. For details see:"
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，\\ ``VCI`` 程序仅计算纯振动态。然而，\\ ``ROVIB`` "
"指令允许计算具有阿贝尔点群分子的转动振动跃迁。这还包括一旦偶极矩曲面被计算后的红外强度，以及在振动计算中可用且被请求时的拉曼强度。详情请参阅："

msgid ""
"``RBAS=2`` a symmetrized rotational basis by employing Wang combinations is "
"used, i.e. :math:`|J K \\tau> = i^\\sigma/\\sqrt{2} (|JK> + "
"(-1)^{J+K+\\tau}|J-K>)`."
msgstr ""
"``RBAS=2`` 使用通过Wang组合对称化的转动基组，即 :math:`|J K \\tau> = i^\\sigma/\\sqrt{2} "
"(|JK> + (-1)^{J+K+\\tau}|J-K>)`\\ 。"

msgid ""
"``RBAS=3`` refers to a molecule specific rotational basis (MSRB) obtained "
"from a linear combination of primitive symmetric top functions."
msgstr "``RBAS=3`` 指通过原始对称陀螺函数的线性组合获得的分子特定转动基组（MSRB）。"

msgid ""
"``RBAS=4`` uses a molecule specific rotational basis (MSRB) generated from a"
" linear combination of Wang combinations."
msgstr "``RBAS=4`` 使用由王组合的线性组合生成的分子特定转动基组（MSRB）。"

msgid ""
"``RBAS=5`` symmetrized Wang combinations are used, i.e. :math:`|J K \\tau> ="
" i^\\tau(-1)^\\sigma/\\sqrt{2} (|JK> + (-1)^{J+K+\\tau}|J-K>)`, which "
"results in a real-valued RVCI matrix, while all other bases lead to a "
"complex RVCI matrix."
msgstr ""
"``RBAS=5`` 使用对称化的王组合，即 :math:`|J K \\tau> = i^\\tau(-1)^\\sigma/\\sqrt{2} "
"(|JK> + (-1)^{J+K+\\tau}|J-K>)`\\ ，这会产生一个实值的 RVCI 矩阵，而所有其他基组都会导致一个复数的 RVCI "
"矩阵。"

msgid "Explicit definition of the correlation space"
msgstr "关联空间的显式定义"

msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

msgid ""
"The following input example for a grid based calculation of anharmonic "
"frequencies and intensities (1) optimizes the geometry of water, (2) "
"computes the harmonic frequencies, (3) generates a potential energy surface "
"around the equilibrium structure, (4) computes the vibrational wave function"
" and the infrared intensities at the ``VSCF`` level, and finally (5) a "
"``VCI`` calculation will be performed. Vibrational angular momentum terms "
"(``VAM``) are included even for the non-diagonal elements of the VCI matrix."
msgstr ""
"以下是一个基于网格的非谐频率和强度计算的输入示例：(1) 优化水的几何结构，(2) 计算谐波频率，(3) 在平衡结构周围生成势能面，(4) 在 "
"``VSCF`` 级别计算振动波函数和红外强度，最后 (5) 执行 ``VCI`` 计算。振动角动量项 (``VAM``) 即使在 VCI "
"矩阵的非对角元中也包含在内。"

msgid ""
"The following input example for an analytical calculation of anharmonic "
"frequencies and intensities (1) optimizes the geometry of water, (2) "
"computes the harmonic frequencies,(3) generates a potential energy surface "
"around the equilibrium structure, (4) converts the potential energy surface "
"into an analytical representation (5) computes the nuclear wave function and"
" the infrared intensities at the ``VSCF`` level, and finally (6) performs a "
"``VCI`` calculation. Vibrational angular momentum terms (``VAM``) are "
"included even for the non-diagonal elements of the VCI matrix."
msgstr ""
"以下是一个基于解析方法的非谐频率和强度计算的输入示例：(1) 优化水的几何结构，(2) 计算谐波频率，(3) 在平衡结构周围生成势能面，(4) "
"将势能面转换为解析表示，(5) 在 ``VSCF`` 级别计算核波函数和红外强度，最后 (6) 执行 ``VCI`` 计算。振动角动量项 "
"(``VAM``) 即使在 VCI 矩阵的非对角元中也包含在内。"

msgid "Record handling"
msgstr "记录处理"

msgid ""
"The ``DISK`` directive allows to specify explicitly, from where the "
"potential information shall be taken and where it shall be stored to disk. "
"This can also be accomplished in an automated manner. These features are "
"only relevant for the simulation of vibronic spectra as one has to deal with"
" several PESs in the same input. For simple VCI calculations, no information"
" is needed here."
msgstr ""
"``DISK`` "
"指令允许明确指定从何处获取势能信息以及将其存储到磁盘的何处。这也可以通过自动方式完成。这些功能仅与振动电子光谱的模拟相关，因为必须在同一输入中处理多个势能面。对于简单的"
" VCI 计算，此处不需要任何信息。"

msgid "The vibrational Møller-Plesset programs (VMP2, VMP3, VMP4)"
msgstr "振动 Møller-Plesset 程序 (VMP2, VMP3, VMP4)"

msgid ""
"The ``VMPx`` (x=2,3,4) programs allow to perform 2nd to 4th order "
"vibrational Møller-Plesset calculations. 3rd and 4th order perturbation "
"theory is only available for polynomial based PESs. Any properties (except "
"energies) will always be computed at the level of VMP2. Most of the keywords"
" as described for the ``VCI`` program are also valid for these "
"perturbational programs, i.e. ``CITYPE, LEVEX, CIMAX, NDIM, VAM, MPG`` and "
"``INFO``."
msgstr ""
"``VMPx`` (x=2,3,4) 程序允许执行二阶至四阶振动 Møller-Plesset "
"计算。三阶和四阶微扰理论仅适用于基于多项式的势能面。任何性质（能量除外）将始终在 VMP2 级别计算。如 ``VCI`` "
"程序所述的大多数关键字对这些微扰程序也有效，即 ``CITYPE, LEVEX, CIMAX, NDIM, VAM, MPG`` 和 "
"``INFO``\\ 。"

msgid "The following *additional options* are available:"
msgstr "以下\\ *附加选项*\\ 可用："

msgid "``VCI,options``"
msgstr "``VCI,options``"

msgid ""
"T. Mathea, G. Rauhut, *Advances in vibrational configuration interaction "
"theory - part 1: Efficient calculation of vibrational angular momentum "
"terms.* `J. Comput. Chem. "
"<https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/abs/10.1002/jcc.26762>`__ **42**, "
"2321–2333 (2021). T. Mathea, T. Petrenko, G. Rauhut, *Advances in "
"vibrational configuration interaction theory - part 2: Fast screening of the"
" correlation space.*. `J. Comput. Chem. "
"<https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/abs/10.1002/jcc.26764>`__ **43**, 6–18 "
"(2022). B. Schröder, G. Rauhut, *From the automated calculation of potential"
" energy surfaces to accurate vibrational spectra*, `J. Phys. Chem. Lett. "
"<https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.jpclett.4c00186>`__ **15**, 3159 (2024)."
msgstr ""
"T. Mathea, G. Rauhut, *Advances in vibrational configuration interaction "
"theory - part 1: Efficient calculation of vibrational angular momentum "
"terms.* `J. Comput. Chem. "
"<https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/abs/10.1002/jcc.26762>`__ **42**, "
"2321–2333 (2021). T. Mathea, T. Petrenko, G. Rauhut, *Advances in "
"vibrational configuration interaction theory - part 2: Fast screening of the"
" correlation space.*. `J. Comput. Chem. "
"<https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/abs/10.1002/jcc.26764>`__ **43**, 6–18 "
"(2022). B. Schröder, G. Rauhut, *From the automated calculation of potential"
" energy surfaces to accurate vibrational spectra*, `J. Phys. Chem. Lett. "
"<https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.jpclett.4c00186>`__ **15**, 3159 (2024)."

msgid ""
"**``CIMAX``\\ =\\ *value*** ``CIMAX`` is the maximum excitation level "
"(maximum sum of quantum numbers) of configurations within the correlation "
"space corresponding to ``CITYPE`` and ``LEVEX``. In principle, a triple "
"configuration :math:`(1^42^43^4)` would contribute to the VCI space. "
"However, ``CIMAX=7`` restricts this to :math:`(1^42^3)`, "
":math:`(1^32^33^1)`, :math:`(1^32^23^2), ...`. The default is ``CIMAX=12`` "
"for 3D potentials and ``CIMAX=15`` for 4D potentials."
msgstr ""
"**``CIMAX``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** ``CIMAX`` 是对应于 ``CITYPE`` 和 ``LEVEX`` "
"的关联空间内组态的最大激发能级（量子数之和的最大值）。原则上，三重激发组态 :math:`(1^42^43^4)` 会贡献到 VCI 空间。然而，\\ "
"``CIMAX=7`` 会将其限制为 :math:`(1^42^3)`\\ 、\\ :math:`(1^32^33^1)`\\ 、\\ "
":math:`(1^32^23^2), ...`\\ 。默认值为三维势能的 ``CIMAX=12`` 和四维势能的 ``CIMAX=15``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"**``CITYPE``\\ =\\ *n*** ``CITYPE`` defines the maximum number of "
"simultaneous excitations with respect to the different modes, i.e. Singles, "
"Doubles, Triples, ... and thus determines the kind of calculations, i.e. "
"VCISD, VCISDT, ... The default is ``CITYPE=4`` (VCISDTQ) for 3D potentials "
"and ``CITYPE=5`` for 4D potentials, which appears to be a fair compromise "
"between accuracy and computational speed. The maximum excitation level is "
"currently limited to ``CITYPE=9``."
msgstr ""
"**``CITYPE``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** ``CITYPE`` "
"定义了相对于不同模式同时激发的最大数目，即单激发、双激发、三激发等，从而决定了计算类型，即 VCISD、VCISDT 等。对于三维势能默认值为 "
"``CITYPE=4``\\ （VCISDTQ），对于四维势能默认值为 ``CITYPE=5``\\ "
"，这似乎是精度与计算速度之间的合理折中。目前最大激发能级受限于 ``CITYPE=9``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"**``CLCTYPE``\\ =\\ *n*** (=2 Default) All VCI programs are based on a real "
"configuration basis. If the state of interest is specified by the :math:`l` "
"quantum number (symmetric top or linear molecules) an appropriate start "
"vector for the iterative eigenvalue solver will be generated automatically. "
"The option ``CLCTYPE`` allows to use different start vectors."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"**``CONT``\\ =\\ *n*** Within the evaluation of the VCI integrals "
"contraction schemes are used to reduce the computational effort. In the "
"analytical VCI program values 0, 1 and 2 are supported. Memory demands and "
"CPU speed-ups increase with increasing values. The default is set to 2, but "
"will be reduced in dependence on the available memory."
msgstr ""
"**``CONT``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 在 VCI 积分求值中，使用收缩方案以减少计算量。在解析 VCI 程序中支持取值 0、1 和 "
"2。内存需求和 CPU 加速比随取值增大而增加。默认值设为 2，但会根据可用内存而降低。"

msgid ""
"**``DIAG``\\ =\\ *n*** In the configuration selective VCI program different "
"diagonalization schemes can be used. ``DIAG``\\ =\\ ``TRS`` uses our "
"residual-based algorithm for the calculation of eigenpairs (RACE), which is "
"the default. Once ``MULTIVCI`` has been switched off, also ``DIAG=CON``, "
"``DIAG=JAC`` and ``DIAG=HJD`` can be used. ``DIAG``\\ =\\ ``CON`` specifies "
"a conventional non-iterative diagonalization as used. ``DIAG``\\ =\\ ``JAC``"
" uses a Jacobi-Davidson scheme and ``DIAG``\\ =\\ ``HJD`` denotes a disk-"
"based Jacobi-Davidson algorithm."
msgstr ""
"**``DIAG``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 在组态选择 VCI 程序中可以使用不同的对角化方案。\\ ``DIAG``\\ =\\ "
"``TRS`` 使用我们基于残差的特征对计算算法（RACE），这是默认值。一旦关闭 ``MULTIVCI``\\ ，也可以使用 "
"``DIAG=CON``\\ 、\\ ``DIAG=JAC`` 和 ``DIAG=HJD``\\ 。\\ ``DIAG``\\ =\\ ``CON`` "
"指定了所使用的常规非迭代对角化。\\ ``DIAG``\\ =\\ ``JAC`` 使用 Jacobi-Davidson 方案，\\ "
"``DIAG``\\ =\\ ``HJD`` 表示基于磁盘的 Jacobi-Davidson 算法。"

msgid ""
"**``EXPORT``\\ =\\ *variable*** If *variable* is set to ``FCON``, important "
"VCI information will be passed to the Franck-Condon calculation. Within "
"Franck-Condon calculations this option *has to be* used."
msgstr ""
"**``EXPORT``\\ =\\ *\\ variable*** 若 *\\ variable\\ * 设为 ``FCON``，重要的 VCI "
"信息将被传递给 Franck-Condon 计算。在 Franck-Condon 计算中*\\ 必须*使用此选项。"

msgid ""
"**``GSMODALS``\\ =\\ *n*** By default all VCI calculations will employ "
"ground-state based VSCF modals, ``GSMODALS=1``. ``GSMODALS=0`` uses the "
"state-specific VSCF modals the subsequent VCI calculations. In any case, "
"individual VCI calculations will be performed for each vibrational state (in"
" contrast to just one VCI calculations from which all solutions will be "
"retrieved) and thus the final VCI wave functions may not be strictly "
"orthogonal to each other once the VCI space is incomplete."
msgstr ""
"**``GSMODALS``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 默认情况下，所有 VCI 计算都将采用基于基态的 VSCF 模态，\\ "
"``GSMODALS=1``\\ 。\\ ``GSMODALS=0`` 则对后续 VCI 计算使用态特定的 VSCF "
"模态。无论如何，都会对每个振动态分别执行 VCI 计算（而不是仅执行一次 VCI 计算并从中获取所有解），因此一旦 VCI 空间不完备，最终的 VCI "
"波函数彼此之间可能不是严格正交的。"

msgid ""
"**``INFO``\\ =\\ *n*** ``INFO=1`` provides a list of the values of all "
"relevant program parameters (options)."
msgstr "**``INFO``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** ``INFO=1`` 提供所有相关程序参数（选项）取值的列表。"

msgid ""
"**``LEVEX``\\ =\\ *n*** ``LEVEX`` determines the level of excitation within "
"one mode, i.e. :math:`0\\rightarrow 1`, :math:`0\\rightarrow 2`, "
":math:`0\\rightarrow 3`, ... The default is ``LEVEX=5``, which was found to "
"be sufficient for many applications."
msgstr ""
"**``LEVEX``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** ``LEVEX`` 确定单个模式内的激发能级，即 :math:`0\\rightarrow "
"1`\\ 、\\ :math:`0\\rightarrow 2`\\ 、\\ :math:`0\\rightarrow 3`\\ 、…… 默认值为 "
"``LEVEX=5``\\ ，已发现该值对许多应用而言足够。"

msgid ""
"**``POT``\\ =\\ *variable*** VCI solutions can be obtained using a potential"
" in grid representation, i.e. ``POT=GRID`` (default), or in an analytical "
"representation, ``POT=POLY``, ``POT=GAUSS`` or ``POT=BSPLINE``. In the "
"latter cases the ``POLY`` program needs to be called prior to the ``VSCF`` "
"and ``VCI`` programs in order to transform the potential."
msgstr ""
"**``POT``\\ =\\ *\\ variable*** 可以使用网格表示的势能（即 ``POT=GRID``\\ ，默认值）或解析表示（\\ "
"``POT=POLY``\\ 、\\ ``POT=GAUSS`` 或 ``POT=BSPLINE``\\ ）来获得 VCI 解。在后几种情况下，需要在 "
"``VSCF`` 和 ``VCI`` 程序之前调用 ``POLY`` 程序以变换势能。"

msgid ""
"**``MPG``\\ =\\ *n*** By default the symmetry of the molecule will be "
"recognized automatically within the ``VCI`` calculations. ``MPG=1`` switches"
" symmetry off."
msgstr "**``MPG``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 默认情况下，\\ ``VCI`` 计算会自动识别分子的对称性。\\ ``MPG=1`` 关闭对称性。"

msgid ""
"**``MULTIVCI``\\ =\\ *n*** (=0 Default) ``MULTIVCI=1`` calls a multi-state "
"VCI, which allows for the simultaneous calculation of several vibrational "
"states, which is particularly useful in case of resonances. See also the "
"option ``NSTSEL``. Besides this the multi-state VCI program in connected "
"with advanced features for the state assignment."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"**``NDIM``\\ =\\ *n*** The expansion of the potential in the ``VCI`` "
"calculation can differ from the expansion in the ``XSURF`` calculation. "
"However, only values less or equal to the one used in the surface "
"calculation can be used. Default: ``NDIM=3``."
msgstr ""
"**``NDIM``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** ``VCI`` 计算中势能的展开可以与 ``XSURF`` "
"计算中的展开不同。但只能使用小于或等于曲面计算中所用值的数值。默认值：\\ ``NDIM=3``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"**``NDIMDIP``\\ =\\ *n*** Term after which the :math:`n`-body expansions of "
"the dipole surfaces are truncated. The default is set to 3. Note that "
"``NDIMDIP`` has to be lower or equal to ``NDIM``."
msgstr ""
"**``NDIMDIP``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 偶极矩曲面的 :math:`n` 体展开截断项。默认值设为 3。注意 ``NDIMDIP`` "
"必须小于或等于 ``NDIM``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"**``NDIMPOL``\\ =\\ *n*** Term after which the :math:`n`-body expansions of "
"the polarizability tensor surfaces are truncated. The default is set to 0. "
"Note that ``NDIMPOL`` has to be lower or equal to ``NDIM``."
msgstr ""
"**``NDIMPOL``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 极化率张量曲面的 :math:`n` 体展开截断项。默认值设为 0。注意 "
"``NDIMPOL`` 必须小于或等于 ``NDIM``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"**``NDIMQUAD``\\ =\\ *n*** Term after which the :math:`n`-body expansions of"
" the quadrupole tensor surfaces are truncated. The default is set to 0. Note"
" that ``NDIMQUAD`` has to be lower or equal to ``NDIM``."
msgstr ""
"**``NDIMQUAD``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 四极矩张量曲面的 :math:`n` 体展开截断项。默认值设为 0。注意 "
"``NDIMQUAD`` 必须小于或等于 ``NDIM``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"**``NSTSEL``\\ =\\ *n*** (=0 (off) Default) Once switched on (``NSTSEL=1``) "
"the configuration selection procedure acts on several states simultaneously."
" The number and identity of these states will be automatically determined. "
"Be aware, that this option leads to a significant increase of CPU time due "
"to enlarged correlation spaces."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"**``PRINT``\\ =\\ *n*** This option provides an extended output. ``PRINT=1``"
" prints the vibrationally averaged rotational constants for all computed "
"states and the associated vibration-rotation constants :math:`\\alpha`. "
"``PRINT=2`` prints the effective 1D polynomials in case that the potential "
"is represented in terms of polynomials, see the option ``POT=POLY`` and the "
"``POLY`` program. In addition the generalized VSCF property integrals, i.e. "
":math:`\\left < VSCF \\left | q_i^r \\right | VSCF \\right >` are printed. "
"These integrals allow for the calculation of arbitrary vibrationally "
"averaged properties once the property surfaces are available. Default: "
"``PRINT=0``."
msgstr ""
"**``PRINT``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 此选项提供扩展输出。\\ ``PRINT=1`` "
"打印所有已计算态的振动平均转动常数以及相关的振转常数 :math:`\\alpha`\\ 。\\ ``PRINT=2`` "
"打印有效的一维多项式（若势能以多项式表示），参见选项 ``POT=POLY`` 和 ``POLY`` 程序。此外还打印广义 VSCF 性质积分，即 "
":math:`\\left < VSCF \\left | q_i^r \\right | VSCF \\right >`\\ "
"。一旦获得性质曲面，这些积分便可用于计算任意振动平均性质。默认值：\\ ``PRINT=0``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"**``REFERENCE``\\ =\\ *n*** This keyword specifies the reference for the "
"definition of the configurations. By default, ``REFERENCE=0`` the reference "
"for all state-specific calculations is the vibrational ground-state "
"configuration. This leads to a violation of the Brillouin condition, but "
"often to also to faster convergence. ``REFERENCE=1`` uses the VSCF "
"configuration as reference for generating all excited configurations. This "
"is the proper way of doing it, but usually requests higher excitation "
"levels."
msgstr ""
"**``REFERENCE``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 此关键字指定用于定义组态的参考态。默认情况下，\\ ``REFERENCE=0``\\ "
"，所有态特定计算的参考态为振动基态组态。这会导致违反 Brillouin 条件，但通常也会带来更快的收敛。\\ ``REFERENCE=1`` 使用 "
"VSCF 组态作为生成所有激发组态的参考。这是更妥当的做法，但通常需要更高的激发能级。"

msgid "<!--"
msgstr "<!--"

msgid ""
"**``SADDLE``\\ =\\ *n*** By default, i.e. ``SADDLE=0``, the ``VCI`` program "
"assumes, that the reference point of the potential belongs to a local "
"minimum. Once the PES calculation has been started from a transition state, "
"this information must be provided to the ``VCI`` program by using "
"``SADDLE=1``. Currently, the ``VCI`` program can only handle symmetrical "
"double-minimum potentials. -->"
msgstr ""
"**``SADDLE``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 默认情况下，即 ``SADDLE=0``\\ ，\\ ``VCI`` "
"程序假定势能的参考点属于局部极小点。一旦 PES 计算从过渡态开始，就必须通过 ``SADDLE=1`` 将该信息提供给 ``VCI`` "
"程序。目前，\\ ``VCI`` 程序只能处理对称双极小势能。-->"

msgid ""
"**``SELSCHEME``\\ =\\ *n*** By default ``SELSCHEME``\\ =1, configurations "
"will be selected by a perturbative criterion. Alternative one may use a "
"criterion based on 2\\ :math:`\\times`\\ 2 VCI matrices (``SELSCHEME``\\ "
"=2). Usually the differences are extremely small and the matrix based "
"criterion is slightly more time-consuming."
msgstr ""
"**``SELSCHEME``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 默认情况下 ``SELSCHEME``\\ "
"=1，组态将通过微扰判据进行选择。另一种方式是使用基于 2\\ :math:`\\times`\\ 2 VCI 矩阵的判据（\\ "
"``SELSCHEME``\\ =2）。通常两者差异极小，且基于矩阵的判据略为耗时。"

msgid ""
"**``SKIPDIAG``\\ =\\ *n*** If ``SKIPDIAG=//n//`` with *n*>1 is set (default:"
" 2), the configuration selection based on a VMP2-like wavefunction is used "
"after the *n*\\ th iteration step, as long as the energy difference between "
"the energy eigenvalues of the last  two iteration steps is less than "
"``THRDIAG`` (see below). ``SKIPDIAG=2`` usually leads to appropriate "
"results."
msgstr ""
"**``SKIPDIAG``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 若设置 ``SKIPDIAG=//n//`` 且 *\\ n\\ "
"*>1（默认值：2），则在第 *\\ n* 次迭代步之后使用基于类 VMP2 波函数的组态选择，只要最后两个迭代步的能量特征值之差小于 "
"``THRDIAG``\\ （见下文）。\\ ``SKIPDIAG=2`` 通常能得到合适的结果。"

msgid ""
"**``SKIPSAVE``\\ =\\ *n*** In cases of small deviations with respect to the "
"norm of the VMP2-like wavefunction, ``SKIPSAVE=1`` may be used to further "
"reduce the computational cost for configuration selection. Note, that "
"renormalization is not possible anymore in this case. The default is "
"``SKIPSAVE=0`` (disabled)."
msgstr ""
"**``SKIPSAVE``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 在类 VMP2 波函数的范数偏差较小的情况下，可使用 ``SKIPSAVE=1`` "
"进一步降低组态选择的计算开销。注意，此时无法再进行重归一化。默认值为 ``SKIPSAVE=0``\\ （禁用）。"

msgid ""
"**``SUBSPACE``\\ =\\ *n*** ``SUBSPACE=1``, which is the default, enables the"
" use of prediagonalization of physically meaningful subspaces."
msgstr "**``SUBSPACE``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** ``SUBSPACE=1``\\ （默认值）启用对物理上有意义的子空间进行预对角化。"

msgid ""
"**``THERMO``\\ =\\ *n*** ``THERMO=1`` allows for the improved calculation of"
" thermodynamical quantities (compare the ``THERMO`` keyword in combination "
"with a harmonic frequency calculation). However, the approach used here is "
"an approximation: While the harmonic approximation is still retained in the "
"equation for the partition functions, the actual values of the frequencies "
"entering into these functions are the anharmonic values derived from the "
"``VCI`` calculation. Default: ``THERMO=0``."
msgstr ""
"**``THERMO``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** ``THERMO=1`` 允许改进热力学量的计算（与简谐频率计算结合使用时请比较 "
"``THERMO`` 关键字）。然而，此处采用的方法是一种近似：虽然配分函数方程中仍保留谐波近似，但进入这些函数的频率实际值是由 ``VCI`` "
"计算得到的非谐值。默认值：\\ ``THERMO=0``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"**``THRCF``\\ =\\ *value*** ``THRCF`` is the threshold for selecting "
"individual configurations. The default is given by ``THRCF``\\ =\\ "
":math:`5\\cdot 10^{-10}`."
msgstr ""
"**``THRCF``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** ``THRCF`` 是选择单个组态的阈值。默认值为 ``THRCF``\\ =\\ "
":math:`5\\cdot 10^{-10}`\\ 。"

msgid ""
"**``THRDIAG``\\ =\\ *value*** The default is ``THRDIAG=1.0d0`` "
"(wavenumbers). ``THRDIAG`` refers to the energy difference between the "
"energy eigenvalues of two consecutive iterations. The VMP2-like wavefunction"
" is employed for configuration selection if the respective energy difference"
" is smaller than ``THRDIAG``, i.e. VCI matrix diagonalizations/eigenvector "
"determinations are omitted."
msgstr ""
"**``THRDIAG``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 默认值为 ``THRDIAG=1.0d0``\\ （波数）。\\ "
"``THRDIAG`` 指的是两次连续迭代的能量特征值之间的能量差。若相应的能量差小于 ``THRDIAG``\\ ，则采用类 VMP2 "
"波函数进行组态选择，即省略 VCI 矩阵对角化/特征向量确定。"

msgid ""
"**``THRECORR``\\ =\\ *value*** Convergence criterion in the case the "
"VMP2-like wavefunction is used for configuration selection. If the sum of "
"energy corrections given by the configurations selected in a specific "
"iteration step is smaller than ``THRECORR``, the final VCI matrix is set-up "
"and the eigenvector is determined. The default is ``THRECORR=1.0d0`` "
"(wavenumbers)."
msgstr ""
"**``THRECORR``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 使用类 VMP2 "
"波函数进行组态选择时的收敛判据。若在特定迭代步中所选组态给出的能量修正之和小于 ``THRECORR``\\ ，则构建最终 VCI "
"矩阵并确定特征向量。默认值为 ``THRECORR=1.0d0``\\ （波数）。"

msgid ""
"**``THRSEL``\\ =\\ *value*** ``THRSEL`` controls the determination of the "
"iterative configuration selection scheme. By default the wavefunction is "
"considered to be converged once energy changes drop below ``THRSEL``\\ =0.02"
" cm\\ :math:`^{-1}`."
msgstr ""
"**``THRSEL``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** ``THRSEL`` 控制迭代组态选择方案的判定。默认情况下，当能量变化降至 "
"``THRSEL``\\ =0.02 cm\\ :math:`^{-1}` 以下时，即认为波函数已收敛。"

msgid ""
"**``THRUP``\\ =\\ *value*** Within the perturbative selection criterion, "
"unselected configurations are excluded from the procedure based on a "
"criterion, which checks on the selection of configuration, which are excited"
" in the same modes. The default is ``THRUP``\\ =\\ :math:`10^{-9}`."
msgstr ""
"**``THRUP``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** "
"在微扰选择判据中，未选中的组态基于一个判据被排除在流程之外，该判据检查在同一模式下被激发的组态的选择情况。默认为 ``THRUP``\\ =\\ "
":math:`10^{-9}`\\ 。"

msgid ""
"**``VAM``\\ =\\ *n*** ``VAM=0``: switches off all vibrational angular "
"momentum terms and the Watson correction term."
msgstr "**``VAM``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** ``VAM=0``\\ ：关闭所有振动角动量项以及 Watson 修正项。"

msgid ""
"``VAM=1``: adds the Watson correction term as a pseudo-potential like "
"contribution to the fine grid of the potential. In the analytical "
"representation of the potential this will already be done in the ``POLY`` "
"program."
msgstr "``VAM=1``\\ ：将 Watson 修正项作为类赝势贡献加入势能的细网格中。在势能的解析表示中，这已在 ``POLY`` 程序中完成。"

msgid ""
"``VAM=2``: the 0D terms of the vibrational angular momentum terms, i.e. "
":math:`\\frac{1}{2} \\sum_{\\alpha\\beta} "
"\\hat{\\pi}_\\alpha\\mu_{\\alpha\\beta} \\hat{\\pi}_\\beta`, and the Watson "
"correction term are included. The VAM-terms will be added to the diagonal "
"elements of the VCI-matrix only. This approximations works rather well for "
"many applications."
msgstr ""
"``VAM=2``\\ ：包含振动角动量项的 0D 项，即 :math:`\\frac{1}{2} \\sum_{\\alpha\\beta} "
"\\hat{\\pi}_\\alpha\\mu_{\\alpha\\beta} \\hat{\\pi}_\\beta`\\ ，以及 Watson "
"修正项。VAM 项仅加入 VCI 矩阵的对角元。该近似在许多应用中效果相当好。"

msgid ""
"``VAM=3``: (default) the :math:`\\mu` tensor is given as the inverse of the "
"moment of inertia tensor at equilibrium geometry, i.e. the 0th order term of"
" the :math:`\\mu`-tensor expansion, but it is added to all elements of the "
"VCI matrix."
msgstr ""
"``VAM=3``\\ ：（默认）\\ :math:`\\mu` 张量取为平衡几何下惯性矩张量的逆，即 :math:`\\mu` 张量展开的 0 "
"阶项，但它被加入 VCI 矩阵的所有元素。"

msgid ""
"``VAM=4``: extends the constant :math:`\\mu`-tensor (0D) by 1D terms. The 1D"
" VAM-terms will be added to the diagonal elements of the VCI-matrix only."
msgstr "``VAM=4``\\ ：将常数 :math:`\\mu` 张量（0D）扩展为 1D 项。1D VAM 项仅加入 VCI 矩阵的对角元。"

msgid ""
"``VAM=5``: includes 0D and 1D :math:`\\mu`-tensor, which are added to all "
"elements of the VCI matrix. Prescreening is used for the 1D terms."
msgstr "``VAM=5``\\ ：包含 0D 和 1D :math:`\\mu` 张量，它们被加入 VCI 矩阵的所有元素。对 1D 项使用预筛。"

msgid ""
"``VAM=6``: includes 0D and 1D terms of the :math:`\\mu`-tensor without "
"prescreening."
msgstr "``VAM=6``\\ ：包含 :math:`\\mu` 张量的 0D 和 1D 项，不使用预筛。"

msgid ""
"``VAM=7``: includes 0D, 1D and 2D terms of the :math:`\\mu`-tensor, which "
"are added to all elements of the VCI matrix. Prescreening is used for the 2D"
" terms only."
msgstr ""
"``VAM=7``\\ ：包含 :math:`\\mu` 张量的 0D、1D 和 2D 项，它们被加入 VCI 矩阵的所有元素。仅对 2D 项使用预筛。"

msgid ""
"``VAM=8``: includes 0D, 1D and 2D terms of the :math:`\\mu`-tensor without "
"any prescreening. Note that the 1D and 2D corrections increase the "
"computational cost considerably and are only available for non-linear "
"molecules."
msgstr ""
"``VAM=8``\\ ：包含 :math:`\\mu` 张量的 0D、1D 和 2D 项，不使用任何预筛。注意，1D 和 2D "
"修正会显著增加计算成本，且仅适用于非线性分子。"

msgid ""
"**``VERSION``\\ =\\ *n*** The ``VCI`` program offers 2 different kinds of "
"``VCI`` implementations: ``VERSION=1`` (which is the default) is a "
"configuration selective and most efficient ``VCI`` program. ``VERSION=2`` is"
" a conventional ``VCI`` program without configuration selection and is "
"operative only in combination with ``MULTIVCI=0``. This version is thus "
"computationally extremely demanding."
msgstr ""
"**``VERSION``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** ``VCI`` 程序提供 2 种不同的 ``VCI`` 实现：\\ "
"``VERSION=1``\\ （默认值）是组态选择型且最高效的 ``VCI`` 程序。\\ ``VERSION=2`` 是不带组态选择的传统 "
"``VCI`` 程序，仅在与 ``MULTIVCI=0`` 组合时可用。因此该版本在计算上要求极高。"

msgid "``ROVIB,options``"
msgstr "``ROVIB,options``"

msgid ""
"S. Erfort, M. Tschoepe, G. Rauhut, *Towards a fully automated calculation of"
" rovibrational infrared intensities for semi-rigid polyatomic molecules*, J."
" Chem. Phys. **152**, 244104 (2020). S. Erfort, M. Tschoepe, G. Rauhut, "
"*Efficient and automated quantum chemical calculation of rovibrational "
"nonresonant Raman spectra.*, J. Chem. Phys. **156**, 124102 (2022). D.F. "
"Dinu, M. Tschoepe, B. Schroeder, K.R. Liedl, G. Rauhut, *Determination of "
"spectroscopic constants from rovibrational configuration interaction "
"calculations.*, J. Chem. Phys. **157**, 154107 (2022)."
msgstr ""
"S. Erfort, M. Tschoepe, G. Rauhut, *Towards a fully automated calculation of"
" rovibrational infrared intensities for semi-rigid polyatomic molecules*, J."
" Chem. Phys. **152**, 244104 (2020). S. Erfort, M. Tschoepe, G. Rauhut, "
"*Efficient and automated quantum chemical calculation of rovibrational "
"nonresonant Raman spectra.*, J. Chem. Phys. **156**, 124102 (2022). D.F. "
"Dinu, M. Tschoepe, B. Schroeder, K.R. Liedl, G. Rauhut, *Determination of "
"spectroscopic constants from rovibrational configuration interaction "
"calculations.*, J. Chem. Phys. **157**, 154107 (2022)."

msgid ""
"**``DUMP_EN``\\ =\\ *string*** File name for dumping the rovibrational state"
" list."
msgstr "**``DUMP_EN``\\ =\\ *\\ string*** 用于转储振转态列表的文件名。"

msgid ""
"**``DUMP_IR``\\ =\\ *string*** File name for dumping the rovibrational "
"infrared line list. Activates calculation of rovibrational intensities."
msgstr "**``DUMP_IR``\\ =\\ *\\ string*** 用于转储振转红外谱线列表的文件名。激活振转强度的计算。"

msgid ""
"**``DUMP_PFIT``\\ =\\ *string*** File name for dumping the term energies for"
" the fitted spectroscopic parameters."
msgstr "**``DUMP_PFIT``\\ =\\ *\\ string*** 用于转储拟合光谱参数项能量的文件名。"

msgid ""
"**``DUMP_QUAD``\\ =\\ *string*** File name for dumping the line list for "
"quadrupole transitions. Activates calculation of rovibrational intensities."
msgstr "**``DUMP_QUAD``\\ =\\ *\\ string*** 用于转储四极跃迁谱线列表的文件名。激活振转强度的计算。"

msgid ""
"**``DUMP_RAMAN``\\ =\\ *string*** File name for dumping the rovibrational "
"Raman line list. Activates calculation of rovibrational intensities."
msgstr "**``DUMP_RAMAN``\\ =\\ *\\ string*** 用于转储振转拉曼谱线列表的文件名。激活振转强度的计算。"

msgid ""
"**``HOTB``\\ =\\ *n*** (=0 (off) Default) The calculation of vibrational hot"
" bands can be switched on with ``HOTB=1``."
msgstr "**``HOTB``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** （=0（关闭）默认）可用 ``HOTB=1`` 开启振动热带（hot band）的计算。"

msgid ""
"**``INFO``\\ =\\ *n*** (=1 Default) Additional rovibrational output. By "
"default this will print the nuclear spin statistical weights. ``INFO=2`` "
"provides additional details on the calculation and assignment of nuclear "
"spin statistical weights. ``INFO=3`` enables further integrals, etc."
msgstr ""
"**``INFO``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** （=1 默认）额外的振转输出。默认情况下会打印核自旋统计权重。\\ ``INFO=2`` "
"提供关于核自旋统计权重计算与指派的更多细节。\\ ``INFO=3`` 启用更多积分等。"

msgid ""
"**``IRUNIT``\\ =\\ *string*** The default unit for the IR intensities in "
"HITRAN units, i.e. cm\\ :math:`^{-1}`/(molecule cm\\ :math:`^{-2}`). "
"Alternatively, one may use ``IRUNIT=KMMOL`` to specify km/mol."
msgstr ""
"**``IRUNIT``\\ =\\ *\\ string*** 红外强度的默认单位为 HITRAN 单位，即 cm\\ "
":math:`^{-1}`/(molecule cm\\ :math:`^{-2}`)。或者，可以使用 ``IRUNIT=KMMOL`` 指定为 "
"km/mol。"

msgid ""
"**``JMAX``\\ =\\ *n*** By default VCI calculations will be performed for "
"non-rotating molecules, i.e. ``J=0``. Rovibrational levels can be computed "
"for arbitrary numbers of ``J$=n$``. This keyword is not mandatory as a "
"default for ``JMAX`` will be determined from the partition function."
msgstr ""
"**``JMAX``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 默认情况下，VCI 计算针对非旋转分子进行，即 ``J=0``\\ 。振转能级可针对任意 "
"``J$=n$`` 计算。此关键字并非强制，因为 ``JMAX`` 的默认值将由配分函数确定。"

msgid ""
"**``JMAX_PRINT``\\ =\\ *n*** (=3 Default for ``JMAX``>3) This option "
"controls the printout in rovibrational calculations, i.e. the maximum J "
"value, up to which information shall be printed."
msgstr ""
"**``JMAX_PRINT``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** （=3，当 ``JMAX``>3 "
"时为默认）此选项控制振转计算中的打印输出，即可输出信息的最大 J 值。"

msgid ""
"**``LLPRINT``\\ =\\ *n*** This keyword controls the rovibrational line list "
"printout. ``LLPRINT=1`` prints the transition moments, ``LLPRINT=2`` "
"symmetry information, ``LLPRINT=3`` the Einstein A coefficients, "
"``LLPRINT=4`` the oscillator strength, and ``LLPRINT=5`` vibrational hot "
"bands. Any of these numbers can be combined, e.g. ``LLPRINT=123`` prints the"
" transition moments, symmetry information and the Einstein A coefficients. "
"This keyword or the ``DUMP_IR`` and/or ``DUMP_RAMAN`` keyword have to be set"
" in order to compute rovibrational intensities."
msgstr ""
"**``LLPRINT``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 此关键字控制振转谱线列表的打印输出。\\ ``LLPRINT=1`` 打印跃迁矩，\\ "
"``LLPRINT=2`` 打印对称性信息，\\ ``LLPRINT=3`` 打印 Einstein A 系数，\\ ``LLPRINT=4`` "
"打印振子强度，\\ ``LLPRINT=5`` 打印振动热带。这些数字可任意组合，例如 ``LLPRINT=123`` 打印跃迁矩、对称性信息和 "
"Einstein A 系数。必须设置此关键字或 ``DUMP_IR`` 和/或 ``DUMP_RAMAN`` 关键字才能计算振转强度。"

msgid ""
"**``NDIMCOR``\\ =\\ *n*** (=2) Order of the :math:`\\mu`-tensor expansion "
"within Coriolis coupling terms. ``NDIMCOR=0`` denotes no Coriolis coupling. "
"``NDIMCOR=1`` considers 0th order terms, ``NDIMCOR=2`` uses 1st order term, "
"``NDIMCOR=3`` is the highest implemented value and uses 2nd order terms."
msgstr ""
"**``NDIMCOR``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** （=2）Coriolis 耦合项中 :math:`\\mu` 张量展开的阶数。\\ "
"``NDIMCOR=0`` 表示无 Coriolis 耦合。\\ ``NDIMCOR=1`` 考虑 0 阶项，\\ ``NDIMCOR=2`` 使用 1"
" 阶项，\\ ``NDIMCOR=3`` 是已实现的最高值，使用 2 阶项。"

msgid ""
"**``NDIMDIP``\\ =\\ *n*** (Default is identical to preceding VCI "
"calculation) Order of the :math:`n`-mode expansion of the dipole surfaces "
"used for the calculation of the vibrational transition moments in "
"rovibrational intensities."
msgstr ""
"**``NDIMDIP``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** （默认与之前的 VCI 计算相同）用于计算振转强度中振动跃迁矩的偶极矩曲面的 "
":math:`n` 模展开阶数。"

msgid ""
"**``NDIMPOL``\\ =\\ *n*** (Default is identical to preceding VCI "
"calculation) Order of the :math:`n`-mode expansion of the polarizability "
"surfaces used for the calculation of the vibrational transition moments in "
"rovibrational intensities."
msgstr ""
"**``NDIMPOL``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** （默认与之前的 VCI 计算相同）用于计算振转强度中振动跃迁矩的极化率曲面的 "
":math:`n` 模展开阶数。"

msgid ""
"**``NDIMQUAD``\\ =\\ *n*** (Default is identical to preceding VCI "
"calculation) Order of the :math:`n`-mode expansion of the quadrupole "
"surfaces used for the calculation of the vibrational transition moments in "
"rovibrational intensities."
msgstr ""
"**``NDIMQUAD``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** （默认与之前的 VCI 计算相同）用于计算振转强度中振动跃迁矩的四极矩曲面的 "
":math:`n` 模展开阶数。"

msgid ""
"**``NSSW``\\ =\\ *'i-j-k...'*** The nuclear spin statistical weights will be"
" determined automatically. However, the can also be provided explicitly by "
"this keyword. The number of NSSWs must match the number of irreps and the "
"different NSSWs need to be separated by minus signs."
msgstr ""
"**``NSSW``\\ =\\ *'i-j-k...'*** 将自动确定核自旋统计权重。然而，也可以通过此关键字显式提供。NSSW "
"的数目必须与不可约表示的数目相匹配，且不同的 NSSW 需要用减号分隔。"

msgid ""
"**``PARTF``\\ =\\ *0,1,2*** (= 1 Default) Mode rovibrational partition "
"function. If equals ``0``, then partition function gets not calculated. For "
"``PARTF=1`` partition function is calculated with separation approximation "
"and for ``PARTF=2`` only all RVCI energies are used."
msgstr ""
"**``PARTF``\\ =\\ *\\ 0,1,2*** (= 1 默认值) 模式振动-转动配分函数。如果等于 ``0``\\ "
"，则不计算配分函数。对于 ``PARTF=1``\\ ，配分函数使用分离近似计算；对于 ``PARTF=2``\\ ，仅使用所有 RVCI 能量。"

msgid ""
"**``PFIT``\\ =\\ *value*** (=0 Default) Fitting of spectroscopic parameters "
"for asymmetric tops using Watson's reduced operator. ``PFIT=1`` activates "
"the fitting procedure if ``JMAX>0``. IR Intensities are not needed for the "
"fitting! By setting ``PFIT=2`` additional printout of the optimization "
"algorithm is provided."
msgstr ""
"**``PFIT``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** (=0 默认值) 使用 Watson 约化算子对不对称陀螺的光谱参数进行拟合。如果 "
"``JMAX>0``\\ ，\\ ``PFIT=1`` 激活拟合过程。拟合不需要红外强度！通过设置 ``PFIT=2``\\ "
"，将额外输出优化算法的打印信息。"

msgid ""
"**``PFITCUT``\\ =\\ *0,1*** (=0 Default) By default, the whole reference "
"data set is used by PFIT. Setting this keyword to (1) will activate a filter"
" that cuts data points with a high residuum from the data set and improves "
"overall convergence slightly."
msgstr ""
"**``PFITCUT``\\ =\\ *\\ 0,1*** (=0 默认值) 默认情况下，PFIT 使用整个参考数据集。将此关键字设置为 (1) "
"将激活一个过滤器，从数据集中剔除具有高残差的数据点，并略微改善整体收敛性。"

msgid ""
"**``PFITLIN``\\ =//0/1//** (=0 Default) Choose whether state energies (0) or"
" transition frequencies (1) should be used as reference data for fitting."
msgstr "**``PFITLIN``\\ =//0/1//** (=0 默认值) 选择使用状态能量 (0) 还是跃迁频率 (1) 作为拟合的参考数据。"

msgid ""
"**``PFITORD``\\ =//2/4/6//** (=6 Default) Select between quadratic, quartic,"
" and sextic expansion of the Watson operator."
msgstr "**``PFITORD``\\ =//2/4/6//** (=6 默认值) 在 Watson 算子的二次、四次和六次展开之间进行选择。"

msgid ""
"**``PFITQNC``\\ =\\ *value*** (=0.999d0 Default) By default, RVCI states "
"with a quantum number assignment confidence below 0.999d0 are not considered"
" in the reference data used by PFIT. Be aware that by changing this value, "
"the fitting results can either improve or deteriorate!"
msgstr ""
"**``PFITQNC``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** (=0.999d0 默认值) 默认情况下，量子数分配置信度低于 0.999d0 的 "
"RVCI 状态不会纳入 PFIT 使用的参考数据中。请注意，更改此值可能会改善或恶化拟合结果！"

msgid ""
"**``PFITRED``\\ =//A/S//** (=A Default) Select between A- and S-reduction of"
" the Watson operator."
msgstr "**``PFITRED``\\ =//A/S//** (=A 默认值) 在 Watson 算子的 A 约化和 S 约化之间进行选择。"

msgid ""
"**``PFITREF``\\ =\\ *value*** (=0 Default) By default, the spectroscopic "
"parameters are fitted with respect to the vibrational ground state. The "
"fitting can be performed for vibrationally excited states, too. Be aware, "
"that Watson's reduced operator may not be appropriate for resonant "
"vibrational states!"
msgstr ""
"**``PFITREF``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** (=0 默认值) "
"默认情况下，光谱参数相对于振动基态进行拟合。拟合也可以针对振动激发态进行。请注意，Watson 约化算子可能不适用于共振振动态！"

msgid ""
"**``RBAS``\\ =\\ *n*** (=5 Default) Definition of the rotational basis in "
"rovibrational calculations."
msgstr "**``RBAS``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** (=5 默认值) 定义振动-转动计算中的转动基组。"

msgid "``RBAS=1`` refers to a primitive symmetric top basis :math:`|Jk>`."
msgstr "``RBAS=1`` 指原始对称陀螺基组 :math:`|Jk>`\\ 。"

msgid ""
"**``RAMAN_POLANG``\\ =\\ *value*** (=90 Default) Raman polarization angle "
"defining the prefactors mixing the isotropic and anisotropic Raman "
"transition moments for the calculation of Raman intensities."
msgstr ""
"**``RAMAN_POLANG``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** (=90 默认值) "
"拉曼偏振角，用于定义计算拉曼强度时混合各向同性和各向异性拉曼跃迁矩的预因子。"

msgid ""
"**``RAMAN_FAC(n)``\\ =\\ *value*** Set the prefactors for the isotropic and "
"anisotropic Raman transition moments for the calculation of Raman "
"intensities manually. :math:`n=0` will set the value for :math:`R_0`, "
":math:`n=2` the one for :math:`R_2`."
msgstr ""
"**``RAMAN_FAC(n)``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 手动设置计算拉曼强度时各向同性和各向异性拉曼跃迁矩的预因子。\\ "
":math:`n=0` 将设置 :math:`R_0` 的值，\\ :math:`n=2` 设置 :math:`R_2` 的值。"

msgid ""
"**``RAMAN_LFREQ``\\ =\\ *value*** (=680 Default, in nm) Raman exciting "
"radiation (laser) frequency."
msgstr "**``RAMAN_LFREQ``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** (=680 默认值，单位 nm) 拉曼激发辐射（激光）频率。"

msgid ""
"**``SPARSITY``\\ =\\ *0,1*** (=1 (on) Default) allows to use sparsity within"
" the storage of the RVCI eigenvectors, which also accelerates the "
"calculation of the infrared intensities."
msgstr ""
"**``SPARSITY``\\ =\\ *\\ 0,1*** (=1 (开启) 默认值) 允许在 RVCI "
"特征向量的存储中使用稀疏性，这也会加速红外强度的计算。"

msgid ""
"**``SYM``\\ =\\ *0,1*** (=1 (on) Default) Abelian point group symmetry is "
"exploited within the construction of the RVCI matrix."
msgstr "**``SYM``\\ =\\ *\\ 0,1*** (=1 (开启) 默认值) 在 RVCI 矩阵的构造中利用阿贝尔点群对称性。"

msgid ""
"**``TEMP``\\ =\\ *value*** (=300 Default, in Kelvin) Spectra for a given "
"temperature can be calculated using the temperature dependent thermal "
"occupation prefactor and the corresponding partition function value."
msgstr ""
"**``TEMP``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** (=300 默认值，单位开尔文) "
"可以使用温度相关的热占据预因子和相应的配分函数值来计算给定温度下的光谱。"

msgid ""
"**``THRHOTB``\\ =\\ *n*** (=5d-2 Default) Minimum of the relative thermal "
"occupation for the lower vibrational mode, in order to be considered as a "
"hot band."
msgstr "**``THRHOTB``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** (=5d-2 默认值) 较低振动模式被视为热谱带所需的最小相对热占据。"

msgid ""
"**``THRROTPF``\\ =\\ *value*** (=\\ :math:`10^{-4}` Default) Threshold for "
"the relative deviation within the iterative determination of the rotational "
"partition function."
msgstr ""
"**``THRROTPF``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** (=\\ :math:`10^{-4}` 默认值) "
"迭代确定转动配分函数时相对偏差的阈值。"

msgid ""
"**``THRRVINT``\\ =\\ *value*** (=10\\ :math:`^{-6}` Default) Threshold for "
"printing rovibrational lines relative to the intensity of the strongest "
"line."
msgstr ""
"**``THRRVINT``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** (=10\\ :math:`^{-6}` 默认值) 打印振动-"
"转动谱线时相对于最强谱线强度的阈值。"

msgid ""
"**``THRSPARS``\\ =\\ *n*** (=5 Default) general sparsity threshold for RVCI "
"eigenvectors. :math:`n` refers to the actual threshold of "
":math:`10^{-n}/(J+1)` with :math:`J` being the rotational quantum number."
msgstr ""
"**``THRSPARS``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** (=5 默认值) RVCI 特征向量的一般稀疏性阈值。\\ :math:`n` 指实际阈值 "
":math:`10^{-n}/(J+1)`\\ ，其中 :math:`J` 为转动量子数。"

msgid ""
"**``THRVIBPF``\\ =\\ *value*** (=\\ :math:`10^{-4}` Default) Threshold for "
"the relative deviation within the iterative determination of the vibrational"
" partition function."
msgstr ""
"**``THRVIBPF``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** (=\\ :math:`10^{-4}` 默认值) "
"迭代确定振动配分函数时相对偏差的阈值。"

msgid ""
"``LEVEX,options\\\\`` Within the VCI program the correlation space can be "
"specified in a general manner (keyword ``LEVEX``), which means that the same"
" number of modals for each mode will be used. Alternatively, one may use the"
" ``LEVEX`` directive. This allows to specify the correlation spaces for the "
"individual modes."
msgstr ""
"``LEVEX,options\\\\`` 在 VCI 程序中，可以以通用方式指定相关空间（关键字 ``LEVEX``\\ "
"），这意味着每个模式将使用相同数量的模态。或者，可以使用 ``LEVEX`` 指令。这允许为各个模式指定相关空间。"

msgid ""
"**``MODE(n)``\\ =\\ *m*** The number of correlating modals for mode *n* is "
"set to *m*."
msgstr "**``MODE(n)``\\ =\\ *\\ m*** 将模式 *\\ n\\ * 的相关模态数设置为 *\\ m*。"

msgid "``DISK,options``"
msgstr "``DISK,options``"

msgid ""
"**``AUTO``\\ =\\ *n*** Rather than using the options ``START`` and ``SAVE`` "
"one may simply assign a label *n* to a a certain PES and all the records "
"will be set automatically."
msgstr ""
"**``AUTO``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 无需使用 ``START`` 和 ``SAVE`` 选项，只需为某个 PES 分配标签 *\\ "
"n*，所有记录将自动设置。"

msgid ""
"**``SAVE``\\ =\\ *record*** This keyword specifies the record where to dump "
"the VCI information."
msgstr "**``SAVE``\\ =\\ *\\ record*** 此关键字指定用于转储 VCI 信息的记录。"

msgid ""
"**``START``\\ =\\ *record*** This card specifies the record from where to "
"read the VSCF information. As the VSCF information usually is stored in the "
"same record as the polynomials, it is usually defined in the ``POLY`` "
"program."
msgstr ""
"**``START``\\ =\\ *\\ record*** 此卡片指定从哪个记录读取 VSCF 信息。由于 VSCF "
"信息通常与多项式存储在同一个记录中，因此通常在 ``POLY`` 程序中定义。"

msgid "``VMPx,options``"
msgstr "``VMPx,options``"

msgid ""
"**``QDEG``\\ =\\ *n*** (=0 default) Quasi-degenerate VMP2 theory (QDVMP2) "
"can be called by ``QDEG=1`` for polynomial based PESs."
msgstr ""
"**``QDEG``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** (=0 默认值) 对于基于多项式的 PES，可以通过 ``QDEG=1`` 调用准简并 VMP2 "
"理论（QDVMP2）。"
